Daniel Ramos's console art for Sparky editions, the base of sparky-stereo-console.
*.client: the Small Business Client edition (2019), from
  /mnt/arquivos/SparkyLinux/SparkyClientKDE/Rolling/SparkySBConfigADClient Rolling.txt
  ("Motd Personalization"): /etc/issue, /etc/motd, /etc/issue.net, /etc/issue.mgetty,
  /etc/update-motd.d/10-uname.
sparky-logo6.txt, sparky-logo7.txt: larger logos, from /mnt/arquivos/SparkyLinux/Art/sparky txt logo/
For Sparky Stereo OS: the edition line becomes Sparky Stereo OS, the system details at the
bottom of issue use getty's escapes (\S{PRETTY_NAME}, \r, \n, \l, \U), "RESTRICTED" stays
with the business client.
